s raining down on you. Dodge, laugh, and grab the cash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/8424c76829b7ef422faca0f098f92e68.poster.avif?t=1763399509\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/8424c76829b7ef422faca0f098f92e68.webm?t=1763399509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/8424c76829b7ef422faca0f098f92e68.mp4?t=1763399509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY GAME IS A NEW CHALLENGE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you face off against your friends, each game throws a different challenge your way. Race with cars, battle on boats, or outsmart your opponents in a variety of mini-games using different strategies to come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/07a4c844a66ecb890e7db004b575f2b1.poster.avif?t=1763399509\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/07a4c844a66ecb890e7db004b575f2b1.webm?t=1763399509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/07a4c844a66ecb890e7db004b575f2b1.mp4?t=1763399509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COSTUMES &amp; CUSTOMIZATION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with a wide range of costumes inspired by pirates, astronauts, samurais, and more! Unlock new outfits as you play and show off your unique style in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/e06e0d43b9e7045bbdc88a22463b8956.poster.avif?t=1763399509\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/e06e0d43b9e7045bbdc88a22463b8956.webm?t=1763399509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/e06e0d43b9e7045bbdc88a22463b8956.mp4?t=1763399509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into a world of crazy fun! Party Madness is packed with non-stop action, laughs, and unexpected adventures. The madness awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Payoff Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/dc887e4ff461bf49ba04d98af0c64e1fa8bc7935/header.jpg?t=1763399509","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3150970/1843933726/8a9bbf86c6e652a230fe24e6cdfc5dbed804f59b/1758721860/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758723673","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai